  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'ArchiView AR

    Augmented Reality Architectural Visualization

    ArchiView
    AR is a mobile augmented reality application that allows users to visualize 3D
    architectural buildings and floor plans in real-world environments.

    Users
    can explore building designs, switch between Building Mode and Floor Plan Mode,
    select 3D models, and place them on detected real-world surfaces using markerless
    AR technology.

    Key Features

    Building Mode: Select and visualize complete
    3D building models.

    Floor Plan Mode: Explore 3D floor plans with interior
    walls and rooms.

    Model Selection: Browse and choose from available architectural
    models.

    Markerless AR: Place and view models on real-world surfaces without
    image markers.

    Interactive Visualization: Move, rotate, and interact with
    placed models.

    Purpose

    The application aims to make architectural visualization
    more interactive and accessible by allowing users to experience building designs
    and interior layouts through augmented reality.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
